WEBVTT

00:04:57.625 --> 00:05:02.601
including the communist societies
of China and Vietnam,

00:05:02.625 --> 00:05:07.268
have performed so spectacularly well
in economic development,

00:05:07.292 --> 00:05:11.518
is because they finally understood,
absorbed and are implementing

00:05:11.542 --> 00:05:13.976
free market economics --

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.268
a gift from the West.

00:05:15.292 --> 00:05:16.875
Adam Smith was right.

00:05:17.667 --> 00:05:20.309
If you let markets decide,

00:05:20.333 --> 00:05:22.250
productivity goes up.

00:05:23.625 --> 00:05:27.184
The second gift was psychological.

00:05:27.208 --> 00:05:30.000
Here too I can speak
from personal experience.